# LightGBM model files use byte-offset-based framing (tree_sizes=...) to jump
# between trees. Git's line-ending conversion (autocrlf) inserts a \r before
# every \n on checkout, which shifts every offset after the first line and
# makes the file unloadable ("Model format error, expect a tree here").
# Force these to be treated as binary so no platform ever rewrites them.
models/*.txt -text
